cpu_pipeline_hazard_sim
a five-stage in-order pipeline: IF ID EX MEM WB, one instruction per stage
`--` in a stage column means the stage is empty that cycle: filling, draining,
a bubble a stall pushed in, or a slot a taken branch squashed

-- program --
i0    LOADI r1, 6
i1    LOADI r2, 7
i2    ADD   r3, r1, r2
i3    MUL   r4, r3, r2
i4    STORE r4, [2]
i5    LOAD  r5, [2]
i6    SUB   r6, r5, r1
i7    BEQ   r6, r4, i14
i8    ADD   r7, r6, r1
i9    MUL   r3, r7, r2
i10   BEQ   r7, r4, i13
i11   SUB   r6, r3, r1
i12   STORE r6, [5]
i13   NOP
i14   STORE r7, [4]
i15   HALT
i16   LOADI r7, -1

