-- architectural results --
forwarding decides when a value is available, never what it is,
so the two runs have to land on the same registers and the same memory
regs (forwarding off): r0=0 r1=6 r2=7 r3=637 r4=91 r5=91 r6=85 r7=91
regs (forwarding on) : r0=0 r1=6 r2=7 r3=637 r4=91 r5=91 r6=85 r7=91
mem  (forwarding off): [0]=0 [1]=0 [2]=91 [3]=0 [4]=91 [5]=0 [6]=0 [7]=0
mem  (forwarding on) : [0]=0 [1]=0 [2]=91 [3]=0 [4]=91 [5]=0 [6]=0 [7]=0
registers identical: yes
memory identical: yes
results identical: yes

